---
const SIGNUP_URL = 'https://go.marginapp.in';
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="reveal lg:order-2">
        <p class="text-xs text-gold-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">DCF Valuation</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-cream leading-tight mb-6">
          Project earnings forward,<br />
          <em class="font-semibold not-italic">find the fair value</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          DCF in Margin lets you build a full financial model — project revenue growth, operating margins,
          depreciation, tax, capex, and working capital year by year.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Discount the resulting free cash flows back to today to get an intrinsic value. Compare it
          against the current price to decide whether the stock is worth buying, holding, or avoiding.
        </p>
        <a
          href={SIGNUP_URL}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors group"
        >
          Try DCF Valuation
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="relative rounded-xl border border-border bg-navy-800/40 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold-400/30 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">DCF Model Inputs</p>
            <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
              {[
                { label: 'Revenue Growth Rate', value: '18%', sub: 'Next 5 years' },
                { label: 'Operating Margin', value: '22%', sub: 'Stabilising assumption' },
                { label: 'Discount Rate', value: '12%', sub: 'Your required return' },
              ].map((row) => (
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-3 border-b border-border/50">
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-ink">{row.label}</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-muted">{row.sub}</p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="font-display text-lg text-cream">{row.value}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-navy-950/60 border border-gold-400/20 p-5">
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1">Intrinsic Value (per share)</p>
              <p class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-gold-400">₹1,840</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-2">vs current price ₹2,340 — 22% premium to fair value</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
              Adjust growth or margin assumptions to stress-test your thesis
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
